@startuml
title Развёртывание (упрощённо)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

node "User Device" as userdev {
  actor "Пользователь\n(Telegram App)" as user
}

cloud "Telegram Cloud" as tg {
  [Telegram Bot API] as api
}

node "Host (Linux/VM)" as host {
  node "Docker Container: bot" as cont {
    [Python 3 + aiogram\nmephi-botcreators-users-bot] as app
    artifact "Temp files\n(/tmp inside container)" as tmp
  }
}

user --> api : сообщения/документы
api <--> app : HTTPS long polling\ngetUpdates/sendMessage/getFile/download
app --> tmp : временное хранение\nэкспортов и xlsx

note bottom of cont
  Переменные окружения:
  • BOT_TOKEN
  • ENV (опционально)
  • MAX_FILE_SIZE_BYTES, MAX_FILES_PER_USER (через config)
end note

@enduml
